  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Making Truth table of the given wave from,</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/2d15ca6c-4cb6-4dc0-a021-62ea4bb90dc2-image.png\" style=\"width: 160px; height: 183px;\" /></p><p>It is clear from the above table that the output is present when both the inputs are high. Even when any of the input is not present, the output is low.&nbsp;This is the function of the AND gate. Hence, the logic gate present is AND gate.</p></blockquote>",
